The victim: Joseph Manfredi

> These criminal illegal aliens from Guatemala both came to the United States illegally as minors and were released by the Obama Administration,

said Acting Assistant Secretary Lauren Bis.

> Now Joseph Manfredi – a husband and a father – is dead because of these monsters who NEVER should have been in our country. ICE has lodged detainers for both of them with our Florida partners to ensure these illegal aliens are never again loose on American streets.

Both brothers entered the United States illegally as minors in California in 2016, on separate dates. They were both RELEASED by the Obama Administration. A Department of Justice (DOJ) Immigration Judge issued Yovany a final order of removal on August 13, 2025, while another Immigration Judge issued Armando a final order on October 18, 2018.

